[0.138, "o", "\r\u001b[9dFinishing the dungeon..."]
[0.200, "o", "\u001b[H \u001b(B\u001b[0;1mEntrance Hall\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[1;44HTension: 0\u001b[1;86HHealth: 16/16\r\u001b[2d Special powers: none\u001b[2;86H"]
[0.000, "o", "C/O/D: 0/0/0\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(0\u001b[0mqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqq\u001b(B\u001b[4;1H\u001b(0\u001b[0m"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B[Your game window is too small for you to use the information panels comfortably. Maximize your\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "window, then type PANELS to enable them.]\r\u001b[6d\u001b[K\u001b[7d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[8d"]
[0.000, "o", "When you claimed that you were tough enough to take on Malygris single-handedly, everyone knew you\r\u001b[9d"]
[0.000, "o", "had been drinking much more than was good for you. And the prince is not one to let an opportunity\r\u001b[10d"]
[0.000, "o", "pass. Before you could so much as protest, his court mage opened a portal and you were shoved\r\u001b[11dthrough. Predictably, the portal immediately disappeared. You doubt they're going to open it up\r\u001b[12d"]
[0.000, "o", "again -- but at least you can try to make good on your boast and kill Malygris, the Wizard of\r\u001b[13d"]
[0.000, "o", "Kerkerkruip!\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mKerkerkruip 9.0.1\r\u001b[16d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mAn IF roguelike by Victor Gijsbers\r\u001b[17d"]
[0.000, "o", "Release 9 / Serial number 140419 / Inform 7 build 6G60 (I6/v6.32 lib 6/12N)\r\u001b[19d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mEntrance Hall\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mThe vast entrance hall is empty, silent, foreboding. Skull-sized rubies project a red light far too\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "bright for the eyes of a human.\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "You possess a wooden buckler, a gilded rapier and three packages of ment.\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "You can see a scroll labelled MORT EILYSH and a fungicide contraption here.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "Exits lead north, south, east and west.\r\u001b[29d>"]
