[0.108, "o", "\u001b7\u001b[4;29r\u001b8\r"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[4S\u001b[1;30r\u001b[26;1HNo warrior could be proud of this small, unimpressive shield. Nonetheless, wearing it will allow you\u001b[27;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "to block incoming attacks. \u001b(B\u001b[0;4mBlock bonus: +1\u001b(B\u001b[m.\r\u001b[29d>"]
[2.405, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ml\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mk\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.136, "o", "\u001b7\u001b[4;29r\u001b8\r"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[9S\u001b[1;30r\u001b[21;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mEntrance Hall\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mThe vast entrance hall is empty, silent, foreboding. Skull-sized rubies project a red light far too\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "bright for the eyes of a human.\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "You can see a scroll labelled MORT EILYSH and a fungicide contraption here.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "Exits lead north, south, east and west.\r\u001b[29d>"]
[2.375, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mn\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
