[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mh\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.163, "o", "\u001b7\u001b[4;29r\u001b8\r\u001b[13S\u001b[1;30r\u001b[1;2H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mHall Of Mirrors\r\u001b[18dHall Of Mirrors\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mMirrors surround you on all sides in an impossible geometry. Myriad reflections follow your every\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "movement -- though some, always in the corner of your eyes, seem to behave differently.\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "A stunning young woman in a simple monk's robe awaits you.\r\u001b[24dYou can also see a flash grenade (multiplied ad infinitum), a teleportation grenade (mirrored all\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "around you) and a fragmentation grenade (copied and copied by mirrors) here.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "An exit leads south (to the entrance hall).\r\u001b[29dAct>"]
